IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `irasa-schemes`

-- Inland Revenue Authority of Singapore Act 1992, ss 5, 10, 17A-17I, 17N, 25, 27, 28, 28A and First and Second Schedules -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_inland-revenue-authority-of-singapore-act-1992.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

